# Dropnook — PIN and users, kept out of compose.yaml.
#   Unraid (Compose Manager Plus): Edit Stack → tab .env — paste this, fill in, Save.
#   Elsewhere: save it as .env next to compose.yaml.
# Then Compose Up. Empty means off. The log of drop says what it found.
# Special characters ($ # " or spaces at the end): single quotes, e.g. PIN='a$b#c'

# One PIN or password for everyone (optional).
# With users: the PIN of every user without one of their own.
PIN=

# Users (optional), one per colour: name:PIN — or the name alone, without a PIN.
# Each gets an area of their own next to the shared one, and the page in their colour.
USER_TEAL=
USER_GOLD=
USER_BLUE=
USER_VIOLET=
USER_CORAL=
